1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,130
Now the cameras are ready.

2
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:02,298
The banner is enormous.

3
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:05,030
Vale steps onto the stationary belt.

4
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:06,510
He raises a solemn hand.

5
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,250
Today, I will experience what these people endured.

6
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:10,870
Mina runs onto the stage.

7
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:11,490
Wait.

8
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,330
You haven't attached the safety clip.

9
00:00:14,810 --> 00:00:16,000
When does the torture begin?

10
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:17,770
It doesn't have to.
